# useMap Composable - Codebase Documentation

A comprehensive Three.js-based interactive 3D map of Uzbekistan with zoom, parallax, and animated labels.

---

## Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Main["index.ts (Orchestrator)"]
        useMap["useMap()"]
        init["init()"]
        animate["animate()"]
        dispose["dispose()"]
        zoomOut["zoomOut()"]
        freeze["freeze()"]
        pause["pause()"]
    end

    subgraph Modules["Helper Modules"]
        camera["camera.ts"]
        loader["loader.ts"]
        labels["labels.ts"]
        markers["markers.ts"]
        grid["grid.ts"]
        textures["textures.ts"]
        config["config.ts"]
        types["types.ts"]
    end

    useMap --> init
    init --> loader
    init --> grid
    animate --> camera
    animate --> markers
    animate --> labels
    loader --> textures
    loader --> markers
    labels --> textures
```

