**Textures Created:**
| Function | Output |
|----------|--------|
| [createFogTexture()](file:///c:/Users/Xensa/Desktop/tour-nuxt/app/composables/useMap/textures.ts#4-38) | Soft cloud sprites |
| [createTextSprite()](file:///c:/Users/Xensa/Desktop/tour-nuxt/app/composables/useMap/textures.ts#66-121) | Country name labels |
| [createGridTexture()](file:///c:/Users/Xensa/Desktop/tour-nuxt/app/composables/useMap/textures.ts#122-174) | Grid overlay for selection |

