## Animation Loop Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant RAF as requestAnimationFrame
    participant Animate as animate()
    participant Tween as tweenGroup
    participant Grid as animateGrid
    participant Camera as updateParallax
    participant Markers as animateMarkers
    participant Labels as updateLabelPositions
    participant Renderer as renderer.render

    RAF->>Animate: Next frame
    Animate->>Animate: Check isPaused
    Animate->>Tween: update()
    Animate->>Grid: animateGrid()
    Animate->>Camera: updateParallax()
    
    alt Not frozen
        Animate->>Markers: animateMarkers()
        Animate->>Markers: updateMarkerScales()
        Animate->>Labels: updateLabelPositions()
        alt Not zoomed
            Animate->>Labels: updateLabelsProximity()
        end
    end
    
    Animate->>Renderer: render(scene, camera)
```

---

## Event Handling

| Event | Handler | Action |
|-------|---------|--------|
| `mousemove` | [handleMouseMove](file:///c:/Users/Xensa/Desktop/tour-nuxt/app/composables/useMap/index.ts#319-327) | Updates parallax target |
| `click` | [handleClick](file:///c:/Users/Xensa/Desktop/tour-nuxt/app/composables/useMap/index.ts#328-374) | Raycasts for markers/labels, triggers zoom |
| `resize` | [handleResize](file:///c:/Users/Xensa/Desktop/tour-nuxt/app/composables/useMap/index.ts#375-381) | Updates camera aspect & renderer size |

**Click Priority:**
1. Check markers first (more accurate)
2. Check label sprites/lines second

---

## State Transitions

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loading: init()
    Loading --> Overview: loadMap() complete
    Overview --> Zoomed: click marker
    Zoomed --> Overview: zoomOut()
    Overview --> Frozen: freeze()
    Frozen --> Overview: unfreeze()
    Overview --> Paused: pause()
    Paused --> Overview: resume()
    Overview --> [*]: dispose()
```

---

## Performance Optimizations

1. **Plain object for zoomBlend** - Avoids Vue reactivity in animation loop
2. **Capped pixel ratio** - `Math.min(devicePixelRatio, 2)`
3. **Conditional antialiasing** - Only on non-HiDPI screens
4. **Reusable instances** - Clock, Raycaster, Vector2 created once
5. **For-loop over forEach** - Fog animation uses indexed loop
6. **Proximity checks skipped when zoomed**

---

## Disposal Checklist

```typescript
dispose() {
  cancelAnimationFrame(animationFrameId)
  
  // Event listeners
  renderer.domElement.removeEventListener('mousemove', ...)
  renderer.domElement.removeEventListener('click', ...)
  window.removeEventListener('resize', ...)
  
  // Tweens
  tweenGroup.removeAll()
  
  // Labels
  disposeLabels(cityLabels)
  
  // Recursive scene traversal
  scene.traverse((obj) => {
    if (Mesh) → geometry.dispose(), material.dispose()
    if (Line) → geometry.dispose(), material.dispose()
    if (Sprite) → geometry.dispose(), material.dispose()
  })
  
  // Renderer
  renderer.dispose()
  container.removeChild(renderer.domElement)
}
```

